  /* A ROW IS A STACK, NOT A SENTENCE. This was one flex row with everything
     in it, so «…640-1236 820 pages start again at 1 read in full» ran together
     as prose and a reader had to parse where one fact ended and the next
     began. Three lines: what it is, what was read, what was found. */
  :global(.mrlist li) { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;
    padding: 11px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 13px; }
